A Spy can also be used to:
- sabotage an enemy unit (reducing its hit points to half), if it isalone on a tile and the players are at war;
- poison the water supply of an enemy city (reducing the populationby one);
- steal specific technology (with a reduced chance of success);
- steal further technologies from a city which has already beenstolen from (although cities become more resistant each time theyare stolen from);
- sabotage predetermined city targets (with a reduced chance ofsuccess).
